Diabetes Prediction

Project Overview

This project uses Machine Learning to predict diabetes based on patient data.

Technologies Used

- Python
- Google Colab
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Seaborn
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn

Machine Learning Algorithm

- Logistic Regression

Techniques Used

- Train Test Split
- Recursive Feature Elimination (RFE)

Project Objective

To build a machine learning model that predicts diabetes using patient health information.
